#. module: theme_linea
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_linea
msgid ""
"A hamburger nav with centered logo and sign-in link opens onto a full-bleed "
"splash hero with overlaid headline and a bottom-anchored CTA, leading into a "
"labeled four-column category grid, flowing into an asymmetric two-panel "
"editorial showcase with full-bleed imagery and inset headlines, then a "
"reviews wall, building toward a dark full-bleed banner CTA with centered "
"copy, followed by a references/logos grid, before closing on a split contact "
"block pairing a full-bleed editorial photo with an inline contact details "
"and opening-hours panel, with clean photo-driven full-bleed imagery "
"throughout and no recurring background shape decoration. Image-forward and "
"fashion-editorial-driven / suited for streetwear brands, independent "
"clothing boutiques, urban lifestyle retailers, footwear labels, and "
"accessories e-commerce stores."
msgstr ""
"汉堡菜单导航居中放置徽标和登录链接，下方是全幅开屏主视觉，叠加标题和底部固定"
"的行动号召，接着是带标签的四栏分类网格，过渡到非对称双面板编辑式展示区，配有"
"满版图片和内嵌标题，然后是评价墙，逐步引出深色满版横幅行动号召，文字居中，其"
"后是参考/徽标网格，最后以分栏联系区块收尾，将满版编辑风格照片与内嵌联系方式和"
"营业时间面板并置；整体采用干净、以照片为主的满版图片，不使用重复的背景形状装"
"饰。以图片为先、时尚编辑风格 / 适合街头服饰品牌、独立服装精品店、都市生活方式"
"零售商、鞋履品牌和配饰电商"

